WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.300
as a leader you have to put others
before yourself and that starts at the

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:16.170
beginning and it starts with everything
that you do you have to let the men eat

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:21.510
first you have to make sure that they
have the gear that they need you have to

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:31.679
let them get rest before you do that's
how it works you have to make sure that

00:00:31.679 --> 00:00:39.750
they have what they need to accomplish
the mission and then on top of that you

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:49.289
have to make sure that the mission
aligns with the good of the troops this

00:00:49.289 --> 00:00:53.640
is hard for some people to understand
but this applies to any organization the

00:00:53.640 --> 00:01:02.870
military a business a sports team and
you have to make sure that the troops

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:13.080
understand that there may be short term
sacrifice there may even be the ultimate

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:29.009
sacrifice in war men may be killed for
the cause but that cause must be just

00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:38.130
and that cause must even in death
benefit those who may have to give that

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:44.579
last full measure and that that may
sound impossible actually because how

00:01:44.579 --> 00:01:50.460
can anyone benefit from their own death
and the answer is actually quite simple

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:57.140
when military personnel risk their lives
they do so to provide safety and

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:07.320
security for their country the country
where their families live and those

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:11.610
individuals put their families above
themselves and as a military leader if

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:15.150
you do see
that emission does not ultimately lead

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:19.080
to the safety and security of the
families of the people that you do lead

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:28.350
then it's your obligation to raise this
up the chain of command and fix it then

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:33.870
the same thing holds true in business as
a leader you must put the good of the

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:43.230
troops above yourself now the thing that
might seem impossible here is that the

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:53.340
overarching measurement of the success
of a business is to be profitable and to

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:59.630
maximize profit one of the things that
you do is you cut costs and one of the

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:10.410
easiest places to cut costs in any
business these people you minimize what

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:17.880
you're paying people or you get rid of
people and then you maximize profit so

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:22.710
how can this leadership principle work
how can you take care of people while at

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:27.030
the same time maximizing profitability
and the answer is that you have to look

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:32.400
at the long game you have to see that
the stronger you build a business the

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:36.690
more long-term stability you build and
the more long-term stability you build

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:45.210
the more stability you build for your
employees and when you're stable that

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:48.630
allows you to grow and when you grow
your business the employees have the

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:55.350
opportunity for growth and those
opportunities improve the lives for

00:03:55.350 --> 00:04:00.890
everyone for the employees for their
family and thereby the whole community

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:09.120
that's what happens but then what
happens when leaders don't put their

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:21.150
people first in the military it can
result in operations gone wrong it can

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:26.340
result in senseless strategies and in
the military it can result

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:36.810
in wasted lives and in business you can
see another kind of destruction in

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:41.520
business it can mean loss of growth for
sure that can mean loss of revenue yes

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:48.139
it can mean loss of jobs but eventually
it can mean the collapsing of

00:04:48.139 --> 00:04:53.990
communities the collapsing of cultures

00:04:55.010 --> 00:05:05.060
now of course a balance has to be found
and profitability must be maintained but

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:15.290
the dollar must not Trump the people and
it certainly must not regardless of your

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:22.289
capitalistic goals the dollar must not
Trump the communities that built the

00:05:22.289 --> 00:05:30.000
businesses in the first place the
pursuit of money must not jeopardize the

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:37.139
very fabric of the country that gives us
the promise for the unhindered pursuit

00:05:37.139 --> 00:05:47.340
of that money in the first place and yet
we've seen that take place we've seen

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:56.599
that take place in our own country in
cities and in towns and in states where

00:05:56.599 --> 00:06:07.770
saving a dollar meant closing a mill and
then shutting down a factory in places

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:14.190
where making more money in the next
financial quarter caused leadership to

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:22.349
forget the long term impact and sell the
future of those people for cash in hand

00:06:22.349 --> 00:06:25.400
in the immediate

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:42.100
and that disease that plague of greed
can spread and it has hurt various parts

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:50.140
of America at various times and when
that's happening while the people at the

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:57.280
top might build themselves a fortune
it's a fortune built on despair and it's

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:04.180
a fortune built on destruction and in
the end that will come back to haunt

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:15.520
them because it is not the right thing
to do and it does not have to be that

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:24.940
way because there are leaders who
recognize the long-term positive impact

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:33.540
of growth and the long-term positive
impact of putting your people first

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:47.400
putting your community first putting
your country first

